{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage <strong>Little</strong> <strong>Rigmen</strong> that will do all the work of e<strong>xtracting Oil</strong> for you.\u00a0  <br><strong>Defend against Pirates</strong> whilst trying to make <strong>as much Profit</strong> as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD AND UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build</strong> <strong>your own Oil Rig</strong>, select from a <strong>variety of buildings</strong>, and build the most <strong>efficient pipeline</strong> to extract Oil from the <strong>underground deposits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666220/extras/BuildSupplyDithered.gif?t=1745604380\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CONTROL YOUR CREW IN FIRST PERSON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Equip your Rigmen</strong> with different weapons to <strong>Fight the Pirate Raids</strong>.  <br><strong>Take Control of a Rigman </strong>and <strong>Shoot Back</strong>, or let them handle it for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666220/extras/FirstPersonFightingDithered.gif?t=1745604380\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEEP UP WITH MAINTANCE OR ELSE ...\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rigmen</strong> need to <strong>fix the Leaks</strong> and <strong>put out the Fires </strong>before it's too late.  <br>You can <strong>equip</strong> your crew with <strong>Fire Extinguishers, Toolkits</strong>, <strong>Weapons</strong>\u00a0and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666220/extras/Explosion_fig.gif?t=1745604380\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FOR UPDATES, SUGGESTIONS AND ROADMAP\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your own Suggestions and Ideas </strong>can<strong>\u00a0</strong>shape the <strong>Game's Future</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666220/extras/DiscordBanner.png?t=1745604380\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666220?t=1745604380","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666220?t=1745604380","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666220/404bca972e2a90ea7ee105217e87aaaa7a938b3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745604380","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666220/404bca972e2a90ea7ee105217e87aaaa7a938b3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745604380","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage <strong>Little</strong> <strong>Rigmen</strong> that will do all the work of e<strong>xtracting Oil</strong> for you.\u00a0  <br><strong>Defend against Pirates</strong> whilst trying to make <strong>as much Profit</strong> as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD AND UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build</strong> <strong>your own Oil Rig</strong>, select from a <strong>variety of buildings</strong>, and build the most <strong>efficient pipeline</strong> to extract Oil from the <strong>underground deposits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666220/extras/BuildSupplyDithered.gif?t=1745604380\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CONTROL YOUR CREW IN FIRST PERSON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><st